<title>USA: Toro Co names treasurer Wolfe CFO.</title>
<headline>Toro Co names treasurer Wolfe CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BLOOMINGTON, Minn. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toro Co, maker of landscaping and irrigation products, said Tuesday it has named its treasurer, Stephen Wolfe, to be chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Wolfe replaces Gerald Knight, who resigned to become chief financial officer of Fingerhut Cos, the company said.  </p>
<p>Wolfe, 48, has been vice president and treasurer of Toro and president of Toro Credit Co, a Toro subsidiary providing floor plan and inventory financing to Toro distributors and large volume dealers, Toro said.</p>
<p>Shares of Toro were unchanged at 36-5/8 Tuesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
